// We can replace existing, already compiled functions/events with their new versions (same names)
// by using the @override annotation. Without the override annotation the engine will abort the
// compilation if it encounters a second function/event with the same name.

@trigger on_init
start main()
    print "Apple\n"
    exit
end

@trigger on_init
@override
start main()
    print "Banana\n"
    exit
end